       Moon conjunct Neptune confers vivid imagination, a refined sense of feeling, a love of solitude and possible psychic or mediumistic abilities. Your life is likely to be full of strange and peculiar experiences, especially at those times when other planets progress to aspects of Neptune. You should have some artistic ability, for you certainly have a very keen appreciation of the sensuous side of art. Your psychic nature is very sensitive, enabling you to attune easily to the feelings and moods of those around you. Dreams can be a profound source of inspiration. At times, others may view you as a little peculiar, having strange notions and a head-in-the-clouds attitude to events."), (25,"MGBD",NULL,"LoHkko vkSj pfj= %
