     The conjunction of Mercury with the planet Mars is a powerful aspect, imparting much energy to your mind, making you very active and energetic mentally. This position will sharpen the wit and make you quick to perceive. You will take expansive views of life, but more from a material than idealist standpoint, being able to tune into current world affairs, especially in matters of enterprise, and business-like situations. The mind is competitive, sharp, shrewd, keen and active, but do guard against impulsive action and the tendency to rush out too quickly towards your objects. With your love of debate you express ideas forcefully, direct to the point, saying exactly what you think; yet often, blind to the opinions of others, you become embroiled in heated argument."), (26,"MGGR",NULL,"LoHkko vkSj pfj= %
