! ft;akb d/j$ed, bkfbwk :[es ozr, ;[v""b B/so ns/ Bow fujok j't/rk.","MARS CONJUNCT JUPITER

     A Mars-Jupiter conjunction vastly increases your energy and vitality - it gives the ability to take self-confident, courageous, decisive and positive action when such is required. You have the enthusiasm and drive to take on tasks that would frighten all but the most courageous - there is a capability to cope with just about every situation. You have the power to concentrate upon a particular aim or objective, and to succeed
you assert yourself fearlessly, even in the face of great danger. Your wholehearted involvement in a cause may be viewed by some as fanaticism or misplaced sentiment. You rise quickly to a challenge, and your competitors have cause for alarm when you oppose them. You express plenty of 'joie de vivre' but you can also be arrogant and a bit of a show off. Although a natural leader, you are inclined to take risks - you have a reckless faith in your ability to tempt fate, never doubting that you will succeed - you don't believe in failure. Many with this aspect find success in a military career, or are active in some form of crusading cause. On occasion you can be over-zealous, chauvinistic, extravagant, and inclined to extremes in feeling. 
     For continued good health it is important that you take plenty of holidays, or periodic rest, in order to prevent physical deterioration or breakdown."), (27,"MGSK",NULL,"LoHkko vkSj pfj= %
