     A Mars conjunct Neptune aspect provides a stimulant for imaginative and dramatic action. You have extraordinary reserves of energy, boundless resources, and a capacity to enter upon Herculean enterprises - at times, you take on more than you can deliver. If the right attitude of mind is maintained, and due regard is paid to the rights and opinions of others, this influence is a tremendous power for accomplishment, and hence for good. There is likely to be an interest in magical forces or the use of occult power - many with this aspect are able to channel psychic energy for spiritual healing. Your desires and ambitions can lead to lofty spiritual achievement, but your goals can also tend toward the impractical, the unrealistic or the overly romantic - leading into misguided activities. At times your actions can be unconsciously motivated and if not recognised and checked this could lead to disaster. You also have a tendency to act through subterfuge and secrecy, and your
movements are often surrounded with mystery."), (31,"BDGR",NULL,"LoHkko vkSj pfj= %
