     The conjunction of Mercury and Saturn gives a slow but and logical mind - practical and controlled. There is a structured depth to the knowledge acquired - superficial factual learning is not your style, you learn slowly but thoroughly. Your mental disposition is thoughtful, serious, tenacious, enduring, patient and conservative, with the ability for deep concentration. You are inclined to ponder, study and brood, over all that comes under your notice. You have the mental strength to endure much difficulty, opposition and suffering without yielding your position. This is an excellent aspect for scientists, designers and engineering draughtsman. On the negative side, there is a predisposition to depression, worry and lack of intellectual self-esteem - avoid becoming too critical and exacting, or you will lose many opportunities to progress."), (34,"BDRH",NULL,"LoHkko vkSj pfj= %
