     Saturn conjunct Uranus bestows practical ability to express original concepts and ideas that have been inspired though the intuitive channels of the mind. This influence is excellent for the serious study of subjects such as metaphysics, science, astrology, New Age and the occult. You are determined, ambitious, inventive, and self-reliant - withi strong powers of concentration On your negative days you can be somewhat obstinate, undisciplined, self-willed and emperamental. Nervous tension is a danger to sustained good health. At some stage of life, you are likely to experience severe limitations of personal liberty, either through the influence of some enemy or through other circumstances over which you have no control - this will have the effect of throwing you in upon yourself and making you reflect deeply on life issues."), (44,"SNKT",NULL,"LoHkko vkSj pfj= %
