INSERT IGNORE INTO `Dasa_Reading` (`ID`, `DasaLord_E`, `DasaPhal_E`, `DasaLord_H`, `DasaPhal_H`, `DasaLord_P`, `DasaPhal_P`) VALUES (1,"(Surya-Surya)","During this period,the native will become important in society and administratively empowered. He will enjoy luxuries. If not controlled, egoism and anger may spoil engagements and relations or  ailments  owing to excess of heat in body.  Blood relatives will feel envious.","¼lw;Z esa lw;Z½","jktea=h ls egÙo feyrk gS vkSj vf/kdkj dh çkfIr gksrh gSA ,s'o;Z rFkk ukuk Hkksxksa dk miHkksx gksrk gSA Øks/k] jksc dh o`fð ls dke fcxM+rs gSaA fiÙk jksx gksrk gSA vkReh; yksx bZ"";kZ djrs gSaA","(;{oi ftZu ;{oi)","fJ; d;ak ftZu nc;oK s'A wjZst fwbdk j?, nfXekoK dh gqkgsh j[zdh j?. GKs^GKs d/ G'rK Bz{ G'rD dk ;wK j[zdk j?. eq'X, o'p d/ tkX/ ekoD ezw fprV ;ed/ jB. d/j ftZu rowh d/ tkX/ ekoD o'r dk j'Dk iK pj[s Biadheh b'eK dh Jhoyk dk f;aeko j'Dk g? ;edk j?."), (2,"(Surya-Chandra)","Benefits from superiors or patrons, gain and success in business, new enterprises, trouble through women, pains in the eyes. Social circle expands and gets strengthened. Pending trifles/quarrels come to an end and consequently amicable environment prevails during this period.Increase of comfort on account of body, females, fortune, enjoyments. However, futile travels/ excursions or discontentment may baffle the native which should be avoided as far as possible.","¼lw;Z esa paæek½","vius yksxksa ls laxfr c<+rh gSA dyg&>xM+s lekIr gksrs gSaA nsg] Hkksx] HkkX;] L=h oxZ ls lq[k esa o`fð gksrh gSA eu esa m}sx jgrk gS] o`Fkk ;k=k,a jgrh gSaA","(;{oi ftZu uzdowk)","fJ; d;ak ftZu nkgD/ b'eK Bkb w/b^fwbkg tXdk j?.  MrV/^Mw/b/ ysw j[zd/ jB.  d/j ;[y ftZu uzrk, gqkgs gdkoEK Bz{ G'rD ftZu P[G, fe;ws dk tkXk ns/ fJ;sohnK s'A ;[y ftZu tkXk j[zdk j?. ;{oi ns/ uzdowk fJZem/ j'D Bkb wZf;nk pDdh j? fi; ekoD uzdowk ewi'o j' frnk j?, fJ; bJh wB ftZu p/u?Bh ofj ;edh j? ns/ ftnoE dhnK :ksoktK j' ;edhnK jB."), (3,"(Surya-Mangla)","There is excess of egoism, anger, impulsiveness, intolerance and straigthtforward ness in these days. Relations, either with  person employed in police, military or having leading position in society,will develop. Native is benefitted through house, land or substance of red colour. Gains/affection through friends or brethern Impurification of blood, excess of heat in body, burning or quarrels may annoy during  the periods of two hot planets.  Therefore, native is advised to feed GUR to cows on Tuesdays and on Surajdays.","¼lw;Z esa eaxy½","jksc] Øks/k] vgadkj] tYnckth] vlfg"".kqrk] Li""Vokfnrk esa o`fð gksrh gSA  eksgjh fdLe ds yksxksa ;k iqfyl&fefyVªh vkfn ls laca/k iuirs gSaA x`g&{ks=] yky jax dh oLrqvksa ls ykHk feyrk gSA fe=&Hkzkrk ls ykHk gksxkA fiÙk] jDr fodkj] nkg d""V ;k >xM+s pyrs gSaA","(;{oi ftZu wzrb)","o'p, eq'X, nDy, ibdpkih, podk;as eoB dk wkdk, tkoskbkg ftZu e'okgD ^ fJBQK ftZu finkdsh j' iKdh j?. w'joh fe;w d/ b'eK, oki^dopko iK fwfbNoh^g[fb; nkfd Bkb ;pzX g?dk j[zd/ jB. xo^y/so, bkb ozr d/ gdkoEK s'A bkG fwbdk j?. fwZso^Gok s'A bkG fwb/rk. rowh, oes^fteko, nrBh^e;aN iK MrV/ ub ;ed/ jB."), (4,"(Surya-Rahu)","Occurrence of undue botherations and unusual problems. Hostility, loss of residence, separation from  beloved ones and unnecessary travelling is experienced. Fearity complex, depression, intoxication, spendthiftness will be realized during this period. Luck favours only in adventurous, risky, diplomatic or underhand activities.","¼lw;Z esa jkgq½","vdkj.k >esys mRiUu gksrs gSaA vn~Hkqr miæo gksrs gSaA ca/ku] LFkkugkfu] o`Fkk ;k=k gksrh gSA Hk;krqj] 'kksdh] O;luh] /ku&O;;h] fo;ksxh jgrk gSA lkgfld dkeksa ls dhfrZ ;k dwVuhfr vFkok nks uacj ds dkeksa ls ykHk jgrk gSA","(;{oi ftZu okj{)","ftnoE jh Mw/b/ rb g?D brd/ jB. nihp'^rohp f;nkg/ fSVd/ jB. pzXB, ;EkB jkBh, p/eko dh :ksoktK j[zdhnK jB. vo, fuzsk, ;a'e, BPk, ci{b^youh, ftS'V/ dh ;zGktBk ofjzdh j?. ;kjf;e ezwK s''A ehosh iK e{NBhsh, d' Bzpo e/ wkwfbnK ftZu bkG j' ;edk j?."), (5,"(Surya-Guru)","Friends will benefit him. He will increase in knowledge and give evidence of his powers in  some  form or other. Employment among people of good position; association with people of high rank. Will overcome all obstacles, and, if married, may have the bird of a child. There will be festivities in the home. Weak points may be that he may   become egoistic resulting into conflict with his superiors.","¼lw;Z esa xq#½","fo}kuksa] fe=ksa vFkok jktk ls lEeku ;k lgk;rk çkIr gksrh gSA iq.;dehZ curk gSA lokjh vkfn lq[k Hkksxs] ?kj esa mRlo rFkk euksjFk ls 'kh?kz ifjiw.kZ rFkk lHkk esa lEeku çkIr gksrk gSA vgadkj esa o`fð rFkk vf/kdkjh ls rdjkj Hk; gksrk gSaA","(;{oi ftZu r[o{)","okik, ftdtkBK, fwZsoK s'A wkB^wdd fwbdh j?. gz[B d/ ezw eodk j?.  ;tkoh nkfd ;[y G'r/, xo ftZu T[s;t ns/ wB'oE S/sh g{o/ j'D ns/ ;Gk ftZu fJZis gqkgs j't/rh. nDy ftZu finkdsh j'D ekoD nfXekoh nkfd Bkb seokopkih j' ;edh j?."), (6,"(Surya-Sani)","Native will fear from king; will have to live under restraint or away from residence. Generally, quarrels arise out of miSurajderstanding without any cause or jobs disrupted.  As such, native is advised to exercise more patience while settling joint-family affairs. As far as outdoor life is concerned, he will attain position by virtue of struggle.  Difference of opinion may prevail between father and the son.","¼lw;Z esa 'kfu½","jktk ls Hk;Hkhr jgrk gSa ca/ku ;k çokl gksaxsA vdkj.k xyrQgeh ls dyg gksrh gS ;k dke fcxM+rs gSaA dkSVqafcd ekeyksa esa lcz&larks""k ls jgsaA ckgjh thou;kiu esa la?k""kZ ls iksth'ku cusxhA firk&iq= esa >xM+k gksrk gSA","(;{oi ftZu ;aBh)","okik Bkb seoko iK wsG/d j' ;ed/ jB. pzXB iK gqtk; j'Dr/. fpBk ekoD rbscfjwh eoe/ wB d[yh j[zdk j? iK ezw fprVd/ jB. fgsk^gZ[so ftZu wsG/d ofj ;ed/ jB. ;KM/ gfotko d/ wkwfbnK ftZu ;po^;zs'y Bkb fojk ikt/. gozs{ pkjob/ wkwfbnK ftZu ;zxo;a MZb e/ g'ih;aB pD/rh."), (7,"(Surya-Budha)","Native will achieve progress through wisdom, education, or eloquence. Average pleasures of new clothes, ornaments and conveyance will be acquired.Great care will be needed to be exercised while signing important documents/ papers.","¼lw;Z esa cq/k½","fo|k&cqfð ;k okpkyrk ds fufeÙk ls mUufr gksrh gSA e/;e eku ls oL=kHkw""k.k] lokjh lq[k feyrk gSA egÙoiw.kZ nLrkostksa ij gLrk{kj djus ls igys fo'ks""k lko/kkuh j[kh tkuh pkfg,A","(;{oi ftZu p[ZX)","ftfdnk, p[ZXh iK ipkB d/ o; d/ fBfwZs Bkb soZeh j[zdh j?. eZgV/^rfjD/, ;tkoh nkfd ftZu dofwnkB/ doi/ dk ;[y fwbdk j?. yk; d;skt/iK s/ d;sys eod/ ;w/A yk; ;ktXkBh oZyh iKdh ukjhdh j?."), (8,"(Surya-Ketu)","Separation of any blood relation, loss of residence, bodily ailments or mental torture is experienced during these mutually enemical planets. He is advised to perform baths at holy places as a remedial measure so that he may unusually be benefitted. For curing bodily diseases,he is suggested to avoid  taking strong medicinaes/pathy and instead use light treatment.","¼lw;Z esa dsrq½","vkReh;&ca/kq fo;ksx] LFkku&Hkz""Vrk] nsg&ihM+k ;k fof{kIr&eu gksrk gSA mik;kFkZ rhFkZ Luku gksuk pkfg,] ftlls fofp= fdLe ds ykHk feysaxsA nsg d""V ds fujkdj.k dks rst nokvksa dh vis{kk gksE;ksiSFkh vkfn lw{e mipkj gksaA","(;{oi ftZu e/s{)","Biadheh fo;as/dkoK dk ftS'Vk, ;EkB jkBh, d/j ghVk iK wB d[yh ofjD d/ :'r jB. T[gkn bJh shoE^;aBkB j'Dk ukjhdk j? fi; Bkb ftfuZso fe;w d/ bkG j' ;ed/ jB. d/j^e;aN s'A S[Nekok gkT[D bJh s/i dtkJhnK dh pikJ/ j'fwUg?Eh nkfd T[guko eotkJ/ ikD."), (9,"(Surya-Sukra)","A possibility of marriage, if not already married. Increase of prosperity. Some bodily sickness. The eyes may be affected. This will be cured. He will do good actions in this period and will reap their reward.","¼lw;Z esa 'kqØ½","'kku&'kkSdr esa o`fð gksrh gSA cM+k LFkku çkIr gksrk gSA xys ;k flj lca/kh dqN d""V dh laHkkouk gksrh gSA vius yksx bZ"";kZ djrs gSaA L=h ds dkj.k Dys'k gks ldrk gSA","(;{oi ftZu P[eo)","PkB^P""es ftZu tkXk j[zdk j?. tZvk ;EkB gqkgs j[zdk j?. rb/ iK f;o ;pzXh wkw{bh e;aN dh ;zGktBk ofjzdh j?. nkgD/ b'e Jhoyk eod/ jB. fe;/ fJ;soh ekoD eb/;a j' ;edk j?."), (10,"(Chandra-Chandra)","Marriage frequently occurs during this period (if not already married/worth marriage),or birth of a child & is fortunate. Native  does  heroic actions and noble deeds. He inclines to public life. He will have changes of residence.  All he wishes will be fulfilled. He is benefitted through females. He should curtail travelling. He must control restlessness and emotionalism lest he should suffer on this account.","¼paæek esa paæek½","ç;kstu dh flfð gksrh gSA oL=kHkw""k.k] lq[k&vkjke ds lk/kuksa esa o`fð gksrh gSA L=h dU;k oxZ ls lq[kh] tu&laidZ okys dkeksa] ;k=k] O;kikj ls YkkHk gksrk gSA eu esa mRlkg] n;kyqrk] lqân;rk c<+rh gSA jktdh; inkf/kdkjh ls dk;Z flfð] vf/kdkj izkfIr gksrh gSA o`Fkk ;k=k,a gks ldrh gSA Hkkoqdrk] papyrk ls gkfu gksxhA","(uzdowk ftZu uzdowk)","fJ; d;ak ftZu gq:'iB dh f;ZXh j[zdh j?. rfjD/^eZgV/, ;[y^nokw d/ ;kXBK ftZu tkXk j[zdk j?. fJ;soh^ezfBnk tor s'A ;[yh, gpfbe^;zgoe, :ksok, tgko s'A bkG ofjzdk j?.  wB ftZu T[s;kj, fdnkb[sk tZXdh j?. oki^dopko ftZu gj[zu pDdh j? ns/ oki^dopko d/ nj[d/dkoK iK nc;oK s'A ekoi^f;ZXh, nfXeko gqkgsh j[zdh j?. ftnoE :ksoktK s'A Nfbnk ikt/. Gkt[esk ns/ uzubsk s'A jkBh j't/rh."), (11,"(Chandra-Mangla)","Assignments undertaken are completed through self-efforts. He  speaks or hears harsh speech.  There is either sale or purchase of  property.  He succeeds in fulfilling his selfish-mottos by  hook or crook.  However, during the periods of Mangal (fire) and Chander (water),  he may become short tempered, restless, jealous or is  afraid  of thief etc. Or, he will be prone to fevers, burning, impurification of blood, diseases due to excess of heat in the body.","¼paæek esa eaxy½","ç;Ru ls dk;Z flfð gksrh gS] fu""Bqj opu cksys ;k lquus iM+saA x`g&{ks= dk Ø;&foØ; gksrk gSA Øqð] papy] bZ"";kZyq vFkok pksjkfn ls Hk;;qDr] Toj] nkg] fiÙk] jDr coklhj ;qDr] LokFkZ lk/kuh gksrk gSA","(uzdowk ftZu wzrb)","fwjBs Bkb ekoi f;ZXh j't/rh. em'o tuB p'b/rk iK ;[DB/ g?Dr/. xo^y/so nkfd dh yohd^t/u bJh P[G ;wK j?. e[VQDk, Jhoykb{, finkdk uzub j'Dk iK