tkXk j[zdk j?."), (14,"(Chandra-Sani)","The partner, (friend or lover) may die or be separated from the native. Much mental torture,obstinacy, agitation, sensitive ness and anxiety is experienced. Attracted to below status deeds or accompanies people of low-category. Afraid of malice of enemy, who may create a scandal, mis-understanding by/regarding close persons.","¼paæek esa 'kfu½","vkxzgh] gBh] fgald] m}sxh curk gSA 'kwæ o.kZ ds yksxksa dh laxfr gksrh gSA  xyrQgeh ls d""V;qDr] 'k=q ls Hk;Hkhr gksrk gSA dkeksa esa fo?u jgrk gS] foyac ls laiUu gksrs gSa ;k fQj dke gksus ij [kq'kh ugha feyrhA","(uzdowk ftZu ;aBh)","fJ; d;ak ftZu gqkDh jmh, fjz;e, T[dt/rh pDdk j?. xNhnk b'eK dh ;zrsh ftZu ofjDk g?Adk j?. rbscfjwh ekoD e;aN:[es, d[;awB s'A vo ofjzdk j?."), (15,"(Chandra-Budha)","Disputes  will  cease. The  native  will have pleasure through  children or love affairs.  Wealth will increase through new ventures. All intentions  will  be accomplished.  In the month - 15th   September  to 15th  October, he will give evidence of some intellectual achievements. However, he should control indecisiveness, confusion and mistakes in decision-making.","¼paæek esa cq/k½","fo|k&fouksn] Kku] O;kikj esa o`fð dk le; gSA lHkk&prqj] O;ogkj dq'ky] LokFkZ&lk/kuh gksrk gSA ifjorZu'khy] uohu dkeksa ls /kukxeA dHkh dHkh vR;f/kd laosnu'khyrk vkSj fdadrZO;foew<+rk ls nq[kh gks ldrk gSA","(uzdowk ftZu p[ZX)","ftfdnk^ftB'd, frnkB, tgko ftZu tkXk ofjzdk j?. ;Gk ftZu us[okJh fdykT[D tkbk, tsho/ ftZu e[;ab ns/ ;tkoE f;ZX eoB tkbk j[zdk j?. gfotosB;ahb, Bt/A^Bt/A ezwK s'A XB nkT[Adk j?. finkdk ;'uD, finkdk ;?Af;fNt pD ikD ekoD c?;b/ b?D ftZu efmBkJh nkT[Adh j?."), (16,"(Chandra-Ketu)","The body of the native will be subjected to some eruptions or swellings and there will be lack of resistance power. Eyes may  suffer. The mind will be filled with cares; and he will experience much trouble. He may incur some public criticism or displeasure; may meet with dishonour or be the means of his own undoing. However, he will accumulate money. Increase of family. Gain through public dealing or business.","¼paæek esa dsrq½","y{eh] f}inkfn dh o`fð gksrh gSA tu laidZ ;k O;kikj ls ykHk] nsg esa dkseyrk] jksx&fujks/kd 'kfDr esa U;wurk vkSj ghu dk;Z gksrs gSaA","(uzdowk ftZu e/s{)","xo ftZu bSwh, d'^g?oK tkb/ ihnK dk tkXk j[zdk j?. gpfbe ;zgoe iK tgko tkb/ ezwK s'A bkG, d/j ftZu e'wbsk, o'r^fBo'Xe ;aesh ftZu ewh ns/ jhB ezw j[zd/ jB."), (17,"(Chandra-Sukra)","Will  be  much associated with females, friends, lovers. Happiness   of those in power and authority, gain of conveyance, new clothes, ornaments,   house/  land.  Will enjoy dainty/juicy meals. Club affairs will be enjoyable.  If the native does not honour females, then the reverse of above is feared.","¼paæek esa 'kqØ½","L=h oxZ] fe=] ca/kq] fç; ls okLrk vf/kd gksrk gSA  jktk dh çlUurk] okgu] oL=kHkw""k.k] x`g esa o`fð] Lokfn""V Hkkst] jl&iku gksrk gSA  xk;u&laxhr dk çlax vkrk gSA","(uzdowk ftZu P[eo)","ftgohs fbzr tkfbnK Bkb, fwZso, fo;as/dko, fgnkfonK Bkb tk;sk finkdk ofjzdk j?. okik dh gq;zBsk, ;tkoh, rfjDk^eZgVk, xo ftZu tkXk, ;tkdh G'iB dk o;^gkB j[zdk j?. rkfJB^;zrhs nkfd dk gq;zr th nkT[Adk j?."), (18,"(Chandra-Surya)","Biliousness and feverish complaints.  Some change in the bodily   appearance.  There is advent of some inner changes. The Moon being a   conductor   of  the solar forces; brings heat and vitality into  the system and quickens all the vital forces, which will materially benefit the native, bringing opportunities for success and gain. However, it is not so favourable in the case of a female.","¼paæek esa lw;Z½","lw;Z eas paæek dh bl n'kk ds nkSjku çk.kh ds ,s'o;Z] /ku&nkSyr vkSj vU; inkFkksaZ dj o`fð jgrh gS D;ksafd lw;Z vkSj paæek nksuksa jktk xzg gSaA  #ds dke iwjs gksrs gSaA  lncqfð çkIr gksrh gSA fe=ksa dh fxurh c<+rh gSA dHkh&dHkh O;FkZ esa gh v'kkar fpÙk jgrs gSaA","(uzdowk ftZu ;{oi)",";{oi ftZu uzdowk dh fJ; d;ak d/ d""okB gqkDh d/ n??;a'^nkokw, XB^d""bs ns/ j'o gdkoEK ftZu tkXk ofjzdk j? feT