), (26,"(Mangla-Surya)","This is a period of Suraj (fire) and Mangal (red hot iron). So, native will be indulged in adventurous actions.  Trouble through persons in position.The wife is likely to be afflicted with disease. Respected in society. Anxieties, fever, blood troubles (pitta dosha) or other inflammatory affections. Danger of fire.Aditya-Haridya Path is advised for remedy.","¼eaxy esa lw;Z½","lkgl ds dkeksa esa rRij gksrk gSA mPpkf/kdkfj;ksa ls fookn gksrk gSA lekt esa eku c<+rk gSA fiÙk] nkg vkfn d""Vksa dk vuqHko gksrk gSA xyk] flj vkfn Åijh Hkkx esa d""V dh laHkkouk jgrh gS ;k fofp= >esyksa ls tw>uk iM+rk gSA vkfnR;ân; ikB ls loZlq[k feyrs gSaA","(wzrb ftZu ;{oi)",";kj; d/ ezwK ftZu ssgo j[zdk j?. T[~u^nfXekohnK Bkb wsG/d ofjzd/ jB. ;wki ftZu wkB tXdk j?. rowh^nrBh nkfd e;aNK dk nB[Gt j[zdk j?. rb/^f;o nkfd T[gob/ fjZf;nK ftZu e;aZN dh ;zGktBk tXdh j? iK ftfuZso Mw/fbnK Bkb i{MDk g? ;edk j?. b'V g?D s/  nkfds:k^johfdnk BK dh g[;se dk gkm j'Dk ukjhdk j?."), (27,"(Mangla-Chandra)","Profit; gain of property and acquisition of valuables. There is likely to be renovations of the house or improvements made therein. But in the  end  of this period, there will be a decrease of all these good effects.","¼eaxy esa paæek½","fe=ksa ls feyki gksrk gSA 'k=qvksa ls Mjus okyk cuus ls gaxkes iSnk ugha gksrsA  oL=kHkw""k.k] x`g&Hkwfe dk ykHk gksrk gSA lq[kn ;k=k,a gksrh gSaA","(wzrb ftZu uzdowk)","fwZsoK Bkb fwbkg j[zdk j?.  d[;awB s'A voB tkbk j'D ekoD jzrkw/ g?dk BjhA j[zd/.  rfjDk^eZgVk, xo^y/so dk bkG j[zdk j?.  ;[y d/D tkbh :ksoktK j'D d/ :'r jB."), (28,"(Rahu-Rahu)","Sudden, unexpected, unforeseen, explosive and unusual events happen. Obstacles in engagements  related with peace and stability   are  experienced. He is unable to co-ordinate persons, places   and   time of events.  There is separation from own persons and  affinity with others.  Worry   for   the sake of worry.  May be poisoned  in   his   body by hurt from animals, or by insects, or by abrasions.  Dis