 of money and other advantages.  Friendly alliances   will be formed.  The wife will be fortunate and a source of happiness.  Benefits  from superiors or those in office above the native.  Some   trouble   will happen through deceit being practised upon  the  native. False friends will come to light in their true colours. But all evils will pass away.","¼jkgq esa 'kqØ½","ukuk ØhM+k,a gksrh gSaA lekt esa O;ogkjdq'ky curk gSA dqVqac ds fdlh lnL; ds xzg fo'ks""k v'kqHk u gksa rks ?kj esa mRlo] xhr&laxhr dk çlax vkrk gS vU;Fkk L=h ds fufeÙk ls dyg ;k çesg d""V jgrk gSA","(okj{ ftZu P[eo)","GKs^GKs dh eohVktK j[zdhnK jB. ;wki ftZu fttjko^e[;ab pDdk j?. xo ftZu T[s;t, wzrb ekoi nkfd dk gq;zr th nkT[Adk j? p;aos/ fe gfotko d/ fe;/ w?Apo d/ frqj finkdk jh yokp Bk j'D toBk fJ;soh d/ fBfwZs ekoD eb/;a iK gqw/j nkfd r[gs o'r j' ;ed/ jB."), (34,"(Rahu-Surya)","Quarrels on account of the family. Benefits from persons in  good position.  Fear and suspicion will arise in connection with the wife, children  and relatives.  Changes of position or residence will  occur.   For  better results, offer water to the Suraj daily, at least, for 40 days continuously.","¼jkgq esa lw;Z½","VSDl vkfn ljdkjh /ku le; ij u tek djok;k tk, rks ekeyk rwy idM+ ldrk gSA O;ogkfjd rkSj ij ukuk la?k""kksZa ;s tw> dj dke flð gksrs gSaA 'k=q] pksj] vfXu] fiÙk jksx ls cpko gsrq lw;Z dks ty viZ.k fd;k tk,A tSls&dSls lekt esa Js""B in miyC/k gksrk gSA","(okj{ ftZu ;{oi)","N?e;, ;oekoh fpb nkfd ;w/A s/ Bk GotkfJnk ikt/ sK wkwbk yokp j' ;edk j?. fttjkoe s""o Bkb eJh ;zxo;aK Bkb i{M e/ ekoi^f;ZXh j[zdh j?. d[;awB, u'o, nrBh iK d/j ftZu fgZs fteko Bkb e;aN j' ;ed/ jB fiBQK d/ pukn bJh ;{oi Bz{ ib uVQkfJnk iKDk ukjhdk j? fi; Bkb ;wki ftZu fit/A^fet/A wkB ns/ ;ao/;am gd fwbdk j?."), (35,"(Rahu-Chandra)","Either native will feel psychologically unwell and inferiority   complex  or, if associated with saints/Guru, spiritual enlightenment.    Sometimes, by misutilizing his powers, loss of relatives, loss of money throug