ive has good children. Happiness in the married state.  Relatives prosper. Trade increase.  Knowledge is gained. He returns from a long journey.  If not already married, he will form an   alliance at this time.  His intentions are fulfilled and his engagements are accomplished. If assions are not controlled, trouble from women, loss of wealth  or  addictiion  can not be ruled out.","¼cq/k esa lw;Z½","cq/k dh egkn'kk rFkk lw;Z dh vUrnZ'kk ds bl le; esa çk.kh 'kqHk cqfð ls ;qDr] lqanj ;'k vkfn ls ,s'o;Zoku] leFkZoku y{eh ;qDr] ifjiw.kZ ?kj okyk gksrk gSA fo'ks""k ,sxzheSaV ;k LVsVeSaV nsrs le; tYnckth u dh tk,A vko';drk iM+us ij ,sDokeSjhu jRu /kkj.k fd;k tk,A","(p[ZX ftZu ;{oi)","p[ZX dh wjkd;ak ns/ ;{oi dh fJ; nzsod;ak d/ ;w/A ftZu gqkDh P[G p[ZXh Bkb :[es, :;a Bkb ;[zdo n?;atfonktkB, ;woEtkB, bSwh:[es, Got/A xo tkbk j[zdk j?. yk; d;skt/i fdzd/ ;w/A iK ;N/Nw?AN fdzd/ ;w/A ibdpkih Bk ehsh ikt/ B[e;kB j' ;edk j?. io{os g?D s/ n?etkw?ohB Br XkoD ehsk ikt/."), (60,"(Budha-Mangla)","This   is  a fortunate period for literary persons.  For others,   danger   of poisonous insects, disorder in stomach, mental tensions (suspiciousness,   forgetfulness),   loss   of   wealth  is experienced.  If needed, give food, containing KHEER and MOONG SABUT to a Brahmin on Monday.","¼cq/k esa eaxy½","[kjhn&csp ds /ka/ks esa vklDr jgrk gSA ekewyh BxSrh gksrh ;k 'kkSfd;k BxSrh djrk gSA yTtkghurk gkL;&fouksnfç;rk] O;aX;fç;rk c<+rh gSA x`gHkwfe vkfn dk Ø;&foØ;] flj nnZ] uoZl ohduSl ¼Luk;q nkSCyZ;rk½ dgha&dgh gksrh ns[kh gSA mik; Lo:Ik nwjLFkku dh ;k=k,a dh tk,aA","(p[ZX ftZu wzrb)","yohd^t/u d/ wkwfbnK ftZu nk;es ofjzdk j?.  fbyk^gVQh ftZu mZrh eoB dk ;pp pDdk j?.  bZikjhBsk, jk;k^iwke ns/ ftnzr :[es tkDh p'bdk j?. xo^y/so nkfd dh yoh^t/u ftZu bkG ofjD dk ;wK j?.  f;js ftZu f;o^dod, B;K dh ewi'oh (Bot; theB?;) th eJh tko d/yh rJh j?. T[gkn bJh d{o^;EkB dh :ksoktK ehshnK ikD."), (61,"(Budha-Rahu)","Will   be  engaged in sale/purchase of things especially property.  Attracted towards   fraudu