distance travel will be rewarding. An  increase of family member will be quite evident.","You will command respect and receive favours from  high ups. Your relationship with parents, seniors will be  harmonious. You may have to visit far off places in this  period. Family life will remain very much in your favour.  Just by making little efforts your income will be on the  increase. If you are already at the threshold of  promotion, it will come your way. Your mind will also bend  towards religious activity or higher philosophy of life. In  general the period is very good.","You will be quite happy during this period. Your  efforts will start giving you good results. You will enjoy  very good relationship with your parents, superiors and  government authorities. A long distance travel shall be  rewarding. Your friends and associates will assist you in  your pursuits. Your mind will bend towards spiritualism or  the higher philosophy of life. There are chances of your  entering in to new business or a changed job. Your opponents  will not be able to do any harm. Minor health ailments could  also be possible.","You will get mixed results in this period. However, you will do good in your profession/trade etc. Your fixity of purpose will remain intact and you will not abandon work once undertaken or lose determination. You would like to support your brothers and sisters. Still your relationship with parents/seniors may be tilting towards the side. At times, you will become too rationale to understand real gist of the things. There is danger of developing egoistic temperament in your personality. This attitude of yours can lead you towards unpopularity. Try to watch yourself inwardly.","  You will come into close contact with the head of some institution. You will develop philanthropic trend towards others. You might get some recognition of your inventive work. On the whole, your reputation and respect will definitely increase. You will be highly esteemed. Travel will be 