quot;okB ihtB Pesh dh xkN ekoD s[;hA nkgD/ nkg Bz{ fBYkb fijk wfj;{; eo'r/. &nbsp;s[;hA nkgDh T{oik ftnoE e/ ekoiK s/ popkd eo'r/. XB jkBh sK j't/rh jh. gfotko d/ w?ApoK dh fprVh j'Jh f;js s[jkvh PKsh Gzr eo/rh. s[jkv/ you/ pj[s tZX ikD dh gqftosh oj/rh. s[jkBz{ fJZSk d/ fybkc ;EkB s/ ofjDk gt/rk. o{jkBh wkwfbnK bJh fJj ;wK uzrk oj/rk. ;kX{^;zsK dk nkPhotkd ns/ frnkB dh gqkgsh j' ;edh j?, tZX s'A tZX ;wK fJ; gk;/ brkfJnk ikt/. fiE/ se d[fBnkth wkwfbnK dk ;pzX j?, fJ; ;wK uzrk BjhA fejk ik ;edk. Bt/A ekoiK Bz{ Bk nozfGnk ikt/. </div>","<div>	fJ; ;w/A d&quot;okB ekoi y/so ftZu iK fojkfJPh y/so ftZu spdhbh ;zGt j?. Gkoh yofunK B/ s[jkBz{ fBokP eo d/Dk j?. :ksoktK Ee/t/A tkbh j'DrhnK ns/ w[nkti/ s'A ofjs j'DrhnK. xo tkfbnK dk Biohnk pdfbnk j'fJnk fdy/rk. s[jkv/ fto'Xh s[jkBz{ B[e;kB gj[zuk ;ed/ jB. r[gs sohe/ Bkb n;kwkfie ezw fpbe[b o'e d/D/ ukjhd/ jB. Pokosh fwZsoK iK fwbD tkfbnK s'A pfunk ikt/ feT[Afe T[BQK d/ ekoD s[jkvh ehosh Bz{ XZek gj[zu/rk. gfotko e/ w?ApoK dh f;js ftnke[bsk dk d[Zik ekoD pD ;edh j?. j' ;e/ sK fJ; ;w/A d&quot;okB :ksok th Bk ehsh ikt/. </div>","<div>	d[ZfinK tZb'A fdZsh rJh B/e ;bkj gqsh s[jkvh bkgotkjh dh gqftosh uzrh BjhA oj/rh. p[o/ ns/ rbs ezwK ftZu bg/N/ ikD dk vo oj/rk. tX/^uVQ/ you/ s[jkBz{ eoiJh pDk ;ed/ jB, fJ; bJh you/ Bz{ BZE gkJh ikt/. rbs c?;b/ b?D eoe/ fuzsk:[es oj'r/. fJ; ;w/A d&quot;okB nkgD/ wB dh jh ubkT[D s'A r[o/ia ehsk ikt/ BjhA sK gSskT[Dk g? ;edk j?. f;js gZy'A fJj ;wK uzrk BjhA j?. fJj ;wK r[gs ftfdnktK iK w'eP wkor bJh P[G cbdkJh oj/rk.</div>");

-- ---- Graha_Yuti ----
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `Graha_Yuti` (
  `_row_id` int unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  `ID` int DEFAULT NULL,
  `Yuti_Name` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,
  `Yuti_Phal` text DEFAULT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (`_row_id`)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;

INSERT IGNORE INTO `Graha_Yuti` (`ID`, `Yuti_Name`, `Yuti_Phal`) VALUES (1,"SRCN","This is a favourable aspect for the mature character because individuality and personality work as one force. Otherwise it produces a one-sided, careless or one-track mind. Also, because your basic personality and the instincts are very similar, you should be free from undue conflicts of the personality. There is a depth of feeling to your personality but this can, on occasion, lead to emotional impulsiveness and hypersensitivity. There will also be a tendency to concentrate your energies into one area of interest. The house and sign positions of the conjunction gives a clue to this area of expression."), (2,"SRMG","Sun conjunct Mars denotes a strong, energetic will, but inclined to passion. Courage, vitality and strength is added to your personality and this gives power for creative attainment. You have a hot-blooded temperament, enjoy a challenge and desire to be in the limelight. It is an excellent aspect for hard, physical work, but this should not be carried to extremes - sometimes the excess energy generated can be just too much to cope with. On the negative side there may be a tendency to exaggeration, impulsiveness and aggression."), (3,"SRBD","This pairing of planets usually gives a strong mind, mental stamina and the ability to absorb knowledge easily. A very personal and subjective outlook gives a creative aspect to the personality. Also, your will-power can be intellectually directed into positive creative expression, especially in ideas, work, and friendships. On occasion, problems could arise through an inflated opinion of self, and an inability to be objectively self-critical."), (4,"SRGR","The Sun conjunct Jupiter brings good fortune through social influence and an expansive, optimistic personality. Much good luck is indicated. Your honest, generous, relaxed, tolerant and sympathetic nature brings many opportunities in life to progress morally and socially - help and success come through your superiors. There is some danger of pride and arrogance."), (5,"SRSK","Sun conjunct Venus gives a refining quality to your personality and adds strength to the emotions. Your cheerful, optimistic, fun-loving and friendly nature makes for romantic and social success. You have an ease of self-expression that is warm, charming, courteous, amiable and sophisticated. Some form of artistic ability or musical talent is indicated. On the negative side there could be a tendency to run after pleasure, pursuing luxury and an easy life."), (6,"SRSN","Your Sun conjunct Saturn aspect means much hard work and many obstacles to overcome before success is finally achieved. Although an excellent executive you will have to face limitations and setbacks which could make you feel sad and depressed at times. However, you possess good organising skills: your serious, self-disciplined, patient, persevering and hard-working attitude ensures ultimate achievement, worldly power and self-fulfilment which is well deserved. There may be some inhibitions that restrict true self-expression and on occasion, others may view you as unsympathetic, selfish, faint-hearted or timid."), (7,"SRRH","Sun conjunct Uranus ensures new exciting experiences in life. This configuration may give genius-potential that drives your personality to experiment with new realms of undiscovered potential - possibly engaged in projects which are regarded as unusual, futuristic or strange. Metaphysical concepts will attract your interest in order that you gain a more advanced understanding of the forces that shape nature and the world. Revolutionary tendencies and a strong character are blended with very original, intuitive and independent qualities. In pursuing your potential or initiating reforms, expect to experience much opposition. Overwork and a strained or tense inner life will give problems with the nerves, this must be recognised and guarded against."), (8,"SRKT","The Sun conjunct Neptune conjunction softens and refines the personality - you are probably idealistic and artistically gifted. There is a strong tendency to delve into the mysterious and, at some stage, metaphysics or occultism will attract your interest. You may possess psychic, clairvoyant or mystical tendencies and, on occasion, others will misunderstand your motives - viewing you as something of a strange character, impressionable and subject to moods. If the mind is not well-developed there is a danger of self-delusion, frailness and a 'head-in-the-clouds' approach to life."), (9,"CNMG","This aspect indicates impulsive emotional actions, a resentment of control and authority, aggressive outbursts and domestic tension. You will experience difficulty controlling your strong feelings - any angry, rash action will alienate others. Therefore do not allow feelings to over-ride your reason, otherwise you could become a very dangerous enemy for someone to have. Be aware that often your actions are emotionally-inspired and just a little thought could prevent instinctive reaction to tense situations. On the plus side, your strong emotions, will-power and fighting spirit could be a drive to positive constructive action."), (10,"CNBD","This gives you a splendid intellect - quick, witty, adaptable, intuitive with good perception. There is a direct link between your logical reasoning mind and the higher unconscious mind. You are objectively aware of your emotional nature and should be able to perceive how thoughts and environmental responses affect your feelings."), (11,"CNGR","The Moon conjunct the benefic planet Jupiter will make your life fortunate, peaceful and successful - whatever difficulties you may have to contend with in life, you will eventually resolve. You will obtain much personal success in life - persons born under this conjunction generally gravitate to good circumstances and surroundings, all of which go to make life progressive and favourable. Emotionally reliable, generous, sympathetic, honest and trustworthy, you attract and gain - through powerful friends - prosperity and success in every direction. You have strong ideals of social betterment and may spend a lot of your time helping the less fortunate, perhaps through religious or educational outlets."), (12,"CNSK","This aspect confers sensitivity, charm and a degree of elegance to your nature. You will be fond of refined and artistic pursuits, and should be fortunate and successful in any undertakings that engage your attention. You are endowed with a loving disposition, intense emotional life, joy of living, the desire for tenderness, artistic appreciation - and a very pleasing personality. Success in romance, a happy family life and good marriage is indicated. However, a tendency to self-indulgence and self-love is likely."), (13,"CNSN","The Moon conjunct Saturn restricts your emotional nature to a degree that other may see you as somewhat sombre and lacking zest for life. Emotional depression may be a problem at some stage. However, common-sense and self-control are given strengths and you are loyal and thoughtful towards your friends and family. You are not in any way demonstrative, but you can be faithful and sincere, with a sense of justice, and fond of responsibility. There is some tendency to become emotionally attached to material things."), (14,"CNRH","With your Moon conjunction to  Rahu you possess original, intellectual, creative, imaginative and intuitive qualities. You place a high emphasis on freedom, and at various periods of your life you will suddenly change direction and make very important changes. Your emotional life will require excitement, change and impulsive action - hence you are often regarded as unreliable by others. You may have peculiar interests and a liking of the strange and unusual - sensitivity to supernatural influences may be evident."), (15,"CNKT","Moon conjunct Ketu confers vivid imagination, a refined sense of feeling, a love of solitude and possible psychic or mediumistic abilities. Your life is likely to be full of strange and peculiar experiences, especially at those times when other planets progress to aspects of Ketu. You should have some artistic ability, for you certainly have a very keen appreciation of the sensuous side of art. Your psychic nature is very sensitive, enabling you to attune easily to the feelings and moods of those around you. Dreams can be a profound source of inspiration. At times, others may view you as a little peculiar, having strange notions and a head-in-the-clouds attitude to events."), (16,"MGBD","The conjunction of Mercury with the planet Mars is a powerful aspect, imparting much energy to your mind, making you very active and energetic mentally. This position will sharpen the wit and make you quick to perceive. You will take expansive views of life, but more from a material than idealist standpoint, being able to tune into current world affairs, especially in matters of enterprise, and business-like situations. The mind is competitive, sharp, shrewd, keen and active, but do guard against impulsive action and the tendency to rush out too quickly towards your objects. With your love of debate you express ideas forcefully, direct to the point, saying exactly what you think; yet often, blind to the opinions of others, you become embroiled in heated argument."), (17,"MGGR","A Mars-Jupiter conjunction vastly increases your energy and vitality - it gives the ability to take self-confident, courageous, decisive and positive action when such is required. You have the enthusiasm and drive to take on tasks that would frighten all but the most courageous - there is a capability to cope with just about every situation. You have the power to concentrate upon a particular aim or objective, and to succeed you assert yourself fearlessly, even in the face of great danger. Your wholehearted involvement in a cause may be viewed by some as fanaticism or misplaced sentiment. You rise quickly to a challenge, and your competitors have cause for alarm when you oppose them. You express plenty of 'joie de vivre' but you can also be arrogant and a bit of a show off. Although a natural leader, you are inclined to take risks - you have a reckless faith in your ability to tempt fate, never doubting that you will succeed - you don't believe in failure. Many with this aspect find success in a military career, or are active in some form of crusading cause. On occasion you can be over-zealous, chauvinistic, extravagant, and inclined to extremes in feeling. For continued good health it is important that you take plenty of holidays, or periodic rest, in order to prevent physical deterioration or breakdown."), (18,"MGSK","Venus conjunct Mars adds a magnetic and passionate dimension to your nature - the creativity conferred by this aspect can be used for direct constructive action in your social or artistic endeavours. Vital, warm and intense, you live life to the full and any excess energy is channelled into a healthy love-life. You can be somewhat impulsive where feeling is concerned, and although very generous, light-hearted and free, at the same time, you are likely to make mistakes in regard to your own feelings - such as falling in love at first sight. Do bear in mind that you are emotionally sensitive and can be easily hurt by others. You can, on occasion, be crude, excitable and lack tenderness and tact."), (19,"MGSN","A Mars-Saturn conjunction suggests inner strength, and the resourceful use of physical energy. You are a good leader of men, able to show courage and strength in situations of danger. On the negative side there is a tendency to anger caused by inhibited self-expression, and an inclination to precipitous action that can lead into violent, dangerous situations - if not checked a brutal, malicious and sadistic nature may emerge."), (20,"MGRH","A Mars conjunct  Rahu aspect drives you to seek exciting outlets for your restless energy, ever pursuing new, original and even dangerous experiences. Revolutionary tendencies augment your restless spirit of adventure and this can be used to precipitate drastic social changes within your environment. It will give you a love of all mystical subjects, especially astrology, and the metaphysical side of things. Beware of sudden impulses to act, rash tendencies, or violent expressions and actions. On occasion you are likely to get carried away by impulsive enthusiasm, mental aberration or just blind impulses. Tension will always be present and you must learn to release this through physical activity. On one of your bad days you can be intolerant, erratic, nervous, obstinate and wilfully."), (21,"MGKT","A Mars conjunct Ketu aspect provides a stimulant for imaginative and dramatic action. You have extraordinary reserves of energy, boundless resources, and a capacity to enter upon Herculean enterprises - at times, you take on more than you can deliver. If the right attitude of mind is maintained, and due regard is paid to the rights and opinions of others, this influence is a tremendous power for accomplishment, and hence for good. There is likely to be an interest in magical forces or the use of occult power - many with this aspect are able to channel psychic energy for spiritual healing. Your desires and ambitions can lead to lofty spiritual achievement, but your goals can also tend toward the impractical, the unrealistic or the overly romantic - leading into misguided activities. At times your actions can be unconsciously motivated and if not recognised and checked this could lead to disaster. You also have a tendency to act through subterfuge and secrecy, and your movements are often surrounded with mystery."), (22,"BDGR","A Mercury-Jupiter conjunction gives a broad and tolerant mind capable of high educational achievement. Possessing an optimistic, joyous and hopeful mental attitude, you tend to see the bright and happy side of life whenever you let the mind assert itself. You have philosophical or religious tendencies, and are therefore capable of obtaining a great amount of benefit through the practice of meditation and contemplation. You are likely to be fortunate in more senses than one, but this is due chiefly to your sound state of mind - great good fortune and success in life is indicated. This is a good aspect for teachers, advisers or directors."), (23,"BDSK","A Mercury-Venus conjunction refines the mental qualities and brings social grace to self-expression. This inclines the mind to be sympathetic, artistic and poetical; you are thus able to appreciate all matters connected with art. Possessing a good eye for colour, and loving all things beautiful, you naturally incline to painting, music, poetry or singing, everything in fact that is likely to give pleasure to yourself and others. You have a well-disposed and friendly disposition, ever choosing the social and pleasurable side of life, not the laborious. You are likely to give much thought to love and romance."), (24,"BDSN","The conjunction of Mercury and Saturn gives a slow but and logical mind - practical and controlled. There is a structured depth to the knowledge acquired - superficial factual learning is not your style, you learn slowly but thoroughly. Your mental disposition is thoughtful, serious, tenacious, enduring, patient and conservative, with the ability for deep concentration. You are inclined to ponder, study and brood, over all that comes under your notice. You have the mental strength to endure much difficulty, opposition and suffering without yielding your position. This is an excellent aspect for scientists, designers and engineering draughtsman. On the negative side, there is a predisposition to depression, worry and lack of intellectual self-esteem - avoid becoming too critical and exacting, or you will lose many opportunities to progress."), (25,"BDRH","A conjunction of Mercury and  Rahu ensures mental originality and an independent, lively and quick mind - intuitive flashes of insight often bring a touch of genius to your mental endeavours. This is an excellent aspect for those interested in occult, metaphysical and astrological work, and for all forms of original thinking, for inventive and ingenious schemes, and for all that applies to New Age thought. You will never be regarded as a dull individual, however your independent, individualistic mind may be regarded, by some, as somewhat eccentric. A good education is essential to ensure that most is gained from your inherent talent. On the negative side, you will at times have too much nervous energy, making you irritable, abrupt, erratic and perhaps given to disregard the feelings and opinions of others."), (26,"BDKT","Mercury conjunct Ketu is a sure sign of spiritual and mystical development. Your sympathetic and gentle mind has the ability to penetrate deep into the collective unconscious to obtain inspiration and knowledge that is not found in any text books - this signifies the union of the mind with the 'higher mind' - or the inspiration. With time you will develop the experience and competence to write or effectively communicate on this subject. On the negative side there can be a lack of clarity and a danger of self-deception, delusions of grandeur, secretiveness, dreaminess and withdrawal from reality."), (27,"GRSK","The Venus conjunct Jupiter is a very fortunate influence and brings success in life through a generous, elegant, optimistic, friendly and easy-going disposition - you have the rare ability of bringing joy and happiness to others. It is a good and propitious position for social affairs and in some respects favourable for financial undertakings. On the negative side, self-indulgence can precipitate health problems."), (28,"GRSN","The Jupiter - Saturn conjunction often means a life of high responsibility; where severe and testing situations need to be overcome before success is finally achieved. However, your completed projects are certain to be well-structured and of long-lasting social value. You are thoughtful, serious, reliable, careful, honest and reliable. With patience, perseverance and hard work you can attain far-reaching objectives and realise your ambitions. There will be periods of severe disappointment alternating with periods of optimism and satisfaction."), (29,"GRRH","With a Jupiter conjunct  Rahu aspect you seek freedom and independence to express your unconventional scientific, philosophical or religious views - you may become involved in New Age, occult, or metaphysical religious groups. The zealous representation of your views concerning your philosophy of life or your religion can lead to a great deal of unnecessary social conflict. At some stage in life sudden opportunities are presented for personal expansion and travel."), (30,"GRKT","The conjunction of Jupiter with Ketu confers extreme sensitivity to intuitive impressions. It is an excellent aspect for idealistic pursuits such as philosophy, mysticism, music, poetry and art. You may possess some form of psychic ability that can be used for the benefit of others. The danger with this placing is the possibility of losing touch with reality and living in a self-deluded, unrealistic dream world."), (31,"SKSN","Venus conjunct Saturn endows you with the practical ability of giving form and structure to any artist tendencies - perhaps through a talent for art or music. You have a somewhat conservative social nature, and possess a peculiar kind of intuition, that makes you appear shrewd and far-seeing. You are thrifty and a keen judge of financial matters but can be miserly on occasion. Some disappointments and sorrow in romantic affairs is indicated. This influence of Saturn does tend to restrict social and romantic relationships, either from outside causes or from your own psychological make-up. Many with this aspect marry purely for practical reasons. Often a sense of duty dominates the inclinations  of the heart."), (32,"SKRH","With Venus conjunct  Rahu a tempestuous love-life is indicated and many pleasant changes of an unexpected nature. With your stimulating, magnetic and independent personality you make an exciting friend, but a very unreliable romantic partner. You have strange urges and inclinations: therefore, any deep attachment is likely to be unconventional, strange or in some way unusual. This influence of planets often gives sudden and unexpected wealth, legacies, windfalls, etc. - or unexpected success through original artistic talent - perhaps music or art."), (33,"SKKT","Venus conjunct Ketu suggests that you are a romantic idealist - warm, kind, compassionate, sympathetic and sensitive to the suffering of others. This influence often gives poetic or artistic talent, and a liking for inspirational art, literature and music based on mystical themes. You have a refined love of nature that renders you deeply sensitive to the beauty of nature and the higher levels of social idealism. On the less positive side this aspect can lead to a poorly-developed sense of reality, impractical romantic dreaming and evasion of duty."), (34,"SNRH","Saturn conjunct  Rahu bestows practical ability to express original concepts and ideas that have been inspired though the intuitive channels of the mind. This influence is excellent for the serious study of subjects such as metaphysics, science, astrology, New Age and the occult. You are determined, ambitious, inventive, and self-reliant - with strong powers of concentration On your negative days you can be somewhat obstinate, undisciplined, self-willed and temperamental. Nervous tension is a danger to sustained good health. At some stage of life, you are likely to experience severe limitations of personal liberty, either through the influence of some enemy or through other circumstances over which you have no control - this will have the effect of throwing you in upon yourself and making you reflect deeply on life issues."), (35,"SNKT","Saturn conjunct Ketu brings the opportunity for mature spiritual insight, and the constructive practical use of intuitive and imaginative contents of the mind - in effect, uniting the mental nature with the spiritual nature. Mystical or religious tendencies are indicated, therefore, this is a fortunate influence that will help to bring practicality and stability to your spiritual aspirations. Your strong power of concentration is conducive to sustained meditation and contemplation - necessary for any form of spiritual development or self-knowing. However, there may be a great conflict at times between your idealist and material natures. This influence may also bring periods of psychic depression difficult to describe, anxiety and morbid imagination - if possible avoid the use of drugs. This contact with Ketu can either elevate the mental nature or severely inhibit and degrade it - depending upon the maturity of personality.");

