     bldh vk;q dk 28oka] 37oka] 46oka] 55oka] 64oka rFkk 73oka o""kZ egRoiw.kZ ifjorZu okyk flð gksxkA","This number gives creativity, individuality and  positiveness .  It makes ambitious, gives rise in the sphere, makes heads  of  circle, authoritative and looked up to by associates. It is symbolic of materialism."), (2,"You come under the cosmic influence of number 2.  Symbolised by the Moon, number 2 gives a gentle, imaginative, artistic and romantic nature.  However, the qualities are moremental than physical.  You are not as forceful in carrying out your ideas.  You should be conscious of being restless and uncertain, lack of continuity of your plans and ideas, over-sensitiveness and lack of self-confidence. 
       People lucky for you are those born on 2,11,20,29,7,16,25,especially if born between 20th June to 21st July.  The persons whose name number adds up to 2,7 or 1 can also 
       be lucky for you.  
       Lucky dates for you are 2,11,20,29.  Secondary lucky dates are 7,16,25. 
       Days of week auspicious for you are Mondays, Sundays and Fridays. 
       Fortunate colours are all shades of green, cream and white. 
       Lucky jewels to be worn next to the skin are pearls, jades and moonstones. 
       Letters of alphabet having harmonious vibrations with your birth number are B,K  and R. 
