     bldh vk;q dk 27oka] 36oka] 45oka] 58oka] 68oka] 72oka rFkk 81oka o""kZ egRoiw.kZ ifjorZu okyk flð gksxkA","This number is related with struggle and labour in every sense of the word.  Great courage in continuity of plans   and   ideas and are organizers. This makes resourceful.  Danger from rashness is denoted."), (10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"It is a number of honor,  of  faith  and  self-confidence of rise and fall but  is   symbolized  as  the  Wheel  of Fortune One's name will be known for good or evil, according to one's desires."), (11,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is an ominous nsumber to occultists. It gives warning  of  hidden  dangers, trial and treachery from others. It has a symbol of a person who will have great difficulties to contend against"), (12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"The symbolism of this number is suffering and anxiety of mind.  It is  also indicated as 'the Sacrifice' or  the Victim' and generally fore shadows one being scarified for the plans or intrigues of others."), (13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"  This is a No. indicating change of plans, place, and suchlike, and is not unfortunate, as is generally supposed.  It is a symbol  of  power which if wrongly used will wreak destruction upon  itself.   It  is a number of upheaval and destruction."), (14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a number of movement, combination of people   and  things, and danger from natural forces, such   as  tempests,  water, air or fire fortunate for dealings with money, speculation and changes in business but   there is always a strong element of risk  and  danger  attached to it but generally owing to the actions and foolhardiness of others."), (15,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is no.of occult significance,of magic and mystery,but as a rule it does not represent the higher side of occultism, its meaning being that the persons represented by it will use every art of magic  they can to carry out their purpose."), (16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This number gives warning of some strange fatality awaiting one, also danger of accidents and defeat of one's plans."), (17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a highly spiritual no. a symbol of peace and love.  It represents that the native risen  superior  in  spirit  to  the trials and difficulties of his life or his career. Native's name live after it."), (18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This number has a difficult symbolism to translate. It is pictured as ‘a rayed moon from which drops of blood are falling, a wolf and a hungry dog are seen below catching the falling drops of blood in their opened mouths, while still lower a crab is seen hastening to join then.’  This no.is mainly indulges the native in materialism & away from spirituality.  It is related  with  quarrels  or social  upheavals  or gaining through them.  it is however, a warning of treachery, deception by others, also danger from the elements, such as storms, water etc.  This no.is regarded as fortunate and extremely favorable.  It is symbolized as `the sun' and  is  called `the  Prince  of  Heaven'.  It is number promising   happiness, success, esteem, and honor, and promises success in one's plans for the future."), (19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no.is regarded as fortunate and extremely favourable.  It is symbolised as `the sun' and  is  called `the  Prince  of  Heaven'. It is number promising   happiness, success, esteem, and honour, and promises success in one's plans for the future."), (20,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no.is called the  awakening  of  new purpose, new plans, new ambitions the call of action, but for some great  purpose,  cause  or duty.  It is not a material no. and consequently is a doubtful one as far as worldly success is concerned."), (21,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"It is a no. of advancement, honors,  elevation  in  life  and general  It means victory after a long fight."), (22,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no.is symbolized by a Good Man blinded by the folly of others .  It is warning no. of illusion and delusion, a good person who lives in a fool's paradise; a dreamer  who  awakens  only  when  surrounded by also a number of false judgment owing to the influence of others."), (23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"It is a promise of success, help from superiors and protection from those in high places."":"), (24,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no.is also fortunate; it promises  the  assistance  and association of those of rank and position  with  one's  plans  it denotes gain through love and the opposite sex."), (25,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a no. denoting strength gained through experience, and benefits obtained through observation of people and things.  It is not deemed exactly `lucky', and its success is given through strife and trials in earlier life."), (26,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no.is full of the gravest warning for the future. It foreshadows  disasters brought about by association with others ruin by bad sections, by partnerships, unions and bad advice."), (27,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a good no.  It is a promise of authority, power and  command. It indicates that reward will come from the productive intellect ,that creative faculties have sown good seeds that will reap a harvest. Persons with this no.at their back should carry out their own ideas and plans"), (28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no. is  full  of contradictions.  It indicates a person of great promise and possibilities who is likely to  see  all  taken away from him unless he carefully provides for the future.  It indicates  loss through trust in others, opposition and competition in trade,  danger of law & likelihood of having to begin life's road over and over again."), (29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This no. indicates uncertainties, treacheries, and deception of others it foreshadows trials, tribulation, & unexpected dangers, unreliable friends, and grief and deception caused by members of the opposite sex."), (30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is  a  no.  of  thoughtful  deduction,  retrospection and mental superiority over one's fellows, but as it seems to belong completely to the mental plane, the persons it represents are likely to put all material things on material things on one side not because they have to, but because they wish to do so.  For this reason, it is neither fortunate nor unfortunate on the mental outlook of the native.  It can be all powerful, but it is can be all powerful, but it is just as often indifferent according to the will or desire of the person."), (31,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a no. of thoughtful deduction, retrospection and mental super. This is a no. of thoughtful deduction, retrospection and mental superiority over one's fellows, but in occult or spiritual  side.   Native is more self-contained, lonely and isolated from his fellows.  It is not a fortunate number from a worldly or material standpoint."), (32,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This number is usually associated with combinations of people.  It is a fortunate no. provided the native holds to  his   own  judgment and opinions, if not, l his plans are likely  to   become  wrecked by the stubbornness and stupidity of others."), (33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This number is also fortunate; it promises  the  assistance  and association of those of rank and position  with  one's  plans  it denotes gain through love and the opposite sex."), (34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a no. denoting strength gained through experience, and benefits obtained through observation of people and things.  It is not deemed exactly `lucky', and its success is given through strife and trials in earlier life."), (35,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This number is full of the gravest warning for the future. It foreshadows  disasters brought about by association with others ruin by bad sections, by partnerships, unions and bad advice."), (36,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,"This is a good no.  It is a promise of authority, power and  command. It indicates that reward will come from the productive intellect ,that creative faculties have sown good seeds that will reap a harvest. Persons with this no