n,  but  in  work  they  have   great application, force of character, strength of will, and often  out disntance   their  more  brilliant  and  talented  rivals.   They naturally love the exact sciences and all practical studies. They love  home  and the duties of home but are not  demonstrative  in attraction.  They  are sincere and true in promises.  Staunch  in friendship,  strong  in principle, and honest in  business.  They should exercise their control over being inclined to reason by  a twelve inch rule, and disbelieve all they cannot understand.","Û vkidk gkFk oXkkZdkj fdLe dk gS D;ksafd gFksyh] vaxqfy;ka vkSj u[k yxHkx oxZ ds vkdkj esa gSaA
